<title>FRANCE: Havas jumps on Canal Plus talks.</title>
<headline>Havas jumps on Canal Plus talks.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in media group Havas jumped 8.26 percent to 439 francs after the company confirmed it was in talks with Generale des Eaux about their stakes in Canal Plus.</p>
<p>Newspapers suggested Havas would sell its stake to Generale des Eaux, with the latter taking a larger stake in Havas. Alcatel Alsthom is also in talks with Generale des Eaux about selling part of its 21.2 percent Havas stake.</p>
<p>Shares in Generale des Eaux were up 0.99 percent at 715 francs, Canal Plus up 0.25 percent at 1,185 and Alcatel advanced 2.19 percent to 558 francs.</p>
</text>
